    ["Which bracelets are good for everyday wear?","Simple gold bracelets, delicate chain bracelets, tennis bracelets, and minimalist designs can work well for everyday wear."],
    ["How should a bracelet fit on the wrist?","A bracelet should feel comfortable without being too tight or too loose. You should have enough room for natural wrist movement without the bracelet slipping excessively."],
    ["How can I measure my bracelet size?","Wrap a measuring tape or a strip of paper around your wrist and note the measurement. Add a small amount of extra space depending on how loose you prefer your bracelet."],
    ["Which bracelet styles are popular for women?","Women commonly choose delicate gold bracelets, diamond bracelets, tennis bracelets, charm bracelets, gemstone bracelets, and elegant statement designs."],
    ["Which bracelets work well for men?","Men can choose simple gold bracelets, diamond bracelets, chain bracelets, cuff styles, link bracelets, and gemstone bracelets depending on their personal style."],
    ["Can bracelets be worn every day?","Yes. Many bracelets are suitable for daily use, especially simple and durable designs. Proper care can help maintain their appearance over time."],
    ["Are Gold Bracelets suitable for everyday wear?","Yes. Gold bracelets can be styled with casual, office, and formal outfits. The right design and weight can make them comfortable for regular use."],
    ["How much does a Gold Bracelet cost?","Gold Bracelet prices depend on gold purity, weight, design, craftsmanship, and any diamonds or gemstones included in the piece."],
    ["Which gold is commonly used for bracelets?","14K and 18K gold are commonly used for jewelry bracelets, while other karat options may also be available depending on the design and market."],
    ["Are White Gold Bracelets easy to style?","Yes. White gold has a clean appearance that works well with both casual and formal outfits and can be paired easily with diamond jewelry."],
    ["Do Rose Gold Bracelets suit everyday outfits?","Yes. Rose gold has a warm appearance and can work well with simple everyday outfits as well as more dressed-up looks."],
    ["Can I buy Yellow Gold Bracelets online?","Yes. Yellow Gold Bracelets are available in many styles, including chain, bangle, link, diamond, and customized designs."],
    ["Are Diamond Bracelets a good choice for gifting?","Yes. Diamond Bracelets can make a meaningful gift for birthdays, anniversaries, weddings, Valentine's Day, and other special occasions."],
    ["How much do Diamond Bracelets usually cost?","The price depends on diamond carat weight, quality, number of stones, metal, design, and craftsmanship. A custom or larger diamond bracelet may have a higher price."],
    ["Which Diamond Bracelet is suitable for everyday wear?","A lightweight diamond bracelet, simple diamond chain, or classic tennis bracelet can work well for everyday styling."],
    ["Why are Diamond Tennis Bracelets popular?","Tennis bracelets feature a continuous or closely arranged line of diamonds, giving them a classic and elegant appearance that can work for many occasions."],
    ["How do I choose a Diamond Tennis Bracelet?","Consider the total carat weight, diamond quality, metal, bracelet length, setting style, security, and your preferred level of sparkle."],
    ["Can men wear Diamond Bracelets?","Yes. Men can wear diamond bracelets in simple and modern styles, including link, chain, cuff, and minimalist designs."],
    ["Are Gold Diamond Bracelets available for women?","Yes. Gold Diamond Bracelets can be made in yellow, white, or rose gold with different diamond settings and design styles."],
    ["Which bracelet is better for a simple look?","Minimalist chain bracelets, delicate gold bracelets, small diamond bracelets, and simple gemstone designs can create a clean and understated appearance."],
    ["Which bracelets create a statement look?","Large cuffs, bold link bracelets, detailed gemstone designs, and statement diamond bracelets can create a more noticeable appearance."],
    ["Can I wear multiple bracelets together?","Yes. Stackable and layered bracelets can be worn together. Mixing different widths, textures, and metals can create a personalized look."],
    ["What is the difference between a bracelet and a bangle?","A bracelet can have flexible links, chains, or other structures, while a bangle is generally a more rigid circular or semi-circular design."],
    ["Are Gemstone Bracelets suitable for women?","Yes. Gemstone Bracelets can add color and personality to an outfit and are available in many styles for women."],
    ["Which gemstones are commonly used in bracelets?","Popular options include ruby, sapphire, emerald, amethyst, aquamarine, opal, garnet, tourmaline, tanzanite, and other colored gemstones."],
    ["Can I combine diamonds with gemstones in a bracelet?","Yes. Diamond Gemstone Bracelets can combine the sparkle of diamonds with the color of gemstones such as sapphire, ruby, emerald, or other stones."],
    ["Are Sapphire Bracelets a good choice for special occasions?","Yes. Sapphire Bracelets can offer a rich color and elegant appearance, making them suitable for weddings, celebrations, and other special events."],
    ["Can I get a Ruby Bracelet in gold?","Yes. Ruby Bracelets can be designed in yellow, white, or rose gold, with diamonds or other gemstones added according to the desired design."],
    ["Which bracelet is suitable as a birthday gift?","Gold bracelets, diamond bracelets, gemstone bracelets, and personalized designs can all make thoughtful birthday gifts depending on the recipient's style."],
    ["Can I customize a bracelet with my own design?","Yes. Custom Bracelets can be developed around your preferred design, metal, gemstones, diamonds, size, and other specifications."],
    ["Can I order a Custom Gold Bracelet?","Yes. Custom Gold Bracelets can be created in different gold colors and karats with personalized design details."],
    ["Can I get a Custom Diamond Bracelet made?","Yes. A Custom Diamond Bracelet can be developed with your preferred diamond shape, carat weight, metal, setting, and overall design."],
    ["Are Personalized Bracelets available?","Yes. Personalized Bracelets can include initials, names, symbols, dates, or other design elements depending on the manufacturing requirements."],
    ["Can bracelets be made with natural gemstones?","Yes. Natural Gemstone Bracelets can be created using stones such as sapphire, ruby, emerald, amethyst, and other gemstones."],
    ["How can I check the quality of a Diamond Bracelet?","Check the diamond specifications, certification where applicable, metal purity, craftsmanship, setting security, and overall finishing before purchasing."],
    ["Are Natural Diamond Bracelets different from Lab Grown Diamond Bracelets?","Yes. Natural diamonds are formed naturally, while lab grown diamonds are produced using controlled technology. Both are diamond materials with different origins."],
    ["Can I buy Lab Grown Diamond Bracelets online?","Yes. Lab Grown Diamond Bracelets are available in various designs, including tennis bracelets, chain bracelets, and customized styles."],
    ["Which is better for a minimalist jewelry collection: Gold or Diamond Bracelets?","Both can work well. A simple gold bracelet offers a clean everyday appearance, while a delicate diamond bracelet adds subtle sparkle."],
    ["What should I check before buying a bracelet online?","Check the bracelet's dimensions, metal purity, weight, gemstone or diamond details, size options, product images, return policy, and seller information."],
    ["Where can I buy Bracelets online?","You can purchase bracelets through jewelry brands, manufacturers, and online jewelry stores that provide clear product details and secure purchasing options."],
    ["Are Affordable Bracelets available in different styles?","Yes. Bracelets are available across different price ranges and styles, including simple gold, gemstone, fashion, and diamond-inspired designs."],
    ["Can I order Wholesale Bracelets for my jewelry store?","Yes. Jewelry businesses can source Wholesale Bracelets in different designs, metals, gemstones, quantities, and specifications."],
    ["Where can retailers find Wholesale Diamond Bracelets?","Retailers can work directly with jewelry manufacturers and wholesale suppliers that offer B2B Diamond Bracelet production and bulk ordering."],
    ["Does Anirudh Jewels offer Wholesale Bracelets?","Anirudh Jewels provides jewelry manufacturing and wholesale solutions, with bracelet designs available according to buyer requirements and product specifications."],
    ["Can Anirudh Jewels manufacture Custom Bracelets?","Yes. Custom bracelet production can be developed according to the required design, metal, gemstones, diamonds, size, and order specifications."],
    ["Can I order Wholesale Gold Bracelets in bulk?","Yes. Wholesale Gold Bracelets can be produced in bulk according to selected designs, gold purity, weight, quantity, and other requirements."],
    ["Are Wholesale Gemstone Bracelets available for retailers?","Yes. Retailers can source Gemstone Bracelets in bulk with different gemstone types, metals, designs, and customization options."],
    ["Can bracelets be manufactured for USA buyers?","Yes. Bracelet manufacturers can develop products for USA buyers according to their required designs, materials, specifications, and order quantities."],
    ["Where can I source Wholesale Bracelets in the USA market?","Businesses can source wholesale bracelets through jewelry manufacturers and B2B suppliers that support bulk orders and customized production for the USA market."],
    ["Are Diamond Bracelets available in different gold colors?","Yes. Diamond Bracelets can be created in yellow gold, white gold, and rose gold, depending on the selected design."],
    ["Which bracelet style is suitable for a wedding?","Tennis bracelets, diamond bracelets, elegant gold designs, gemstone bracelets, and detailed bridal styles can complement wedding outfits."],
    ["Can I wear a Diamond Bracelet with a watch?","Yes. A Diamond Bracelet can be worn with a watch, especially when the bracelet has a simple design that complements the watch rather than competing with it."],
    ["How should I care for a Gold or Diamond Bracelet?","Keep the bracelet away from harsh chemicals, store it separately when not in use, and clean it gently using an appropriate jewelry-care method."],
    ["Which bracelet makes a good anniversary gift?","Diamond bracelets, gold bracelets, personalized bracelets, and gemstone designs can all be suitable anniversary gifts depending on personal taste."],
    ["Are Tennis Bracelets only for women?","No. Tennis bracelets can be designed for both women and men, with differences in size, diamond arrangement, width, and overall styling."],
    ["Can I choose different diamond shapes for a Custom Bracelet?","Yes. Custom Diamond Bracelets can use round, oval, pear, princess, emerald, and other diamond shapes depending on the design."],
    ["How do I choose a bracelet for my jewelry business?","Consider your target customers, preferred styles, price range, metal options, stone quality, minimum order quantity, customization, and supplier reliability."],
    ["Can a jewelry manufacturer create bracelets from my reference design?","Yes. Many jewelry manufacturers can develop a bracelet based on a reference image or design concept, subject to technical and manufacturing requirements."],
    ["What should I ask a bracelet manufacturer before placing a bulk order?","Ask about metal purity, gemstone or diamond specifications, customization, production capacity, minimum order quantity, pricing, quality checks, packaging, and delivery timelines."]
  ];

  const listEl = document.getElementById('faqList');
  const countEl = document.getElementById('faqCount');
  const emptyEl = document.getElementById('faqEmpty');

  function renderFAQs(items){
    listEl.innerHTML = '';
    items.forEach(([q,a], idx) => {
      const item = document.createElement('div');
      item.className = 'faq-item';
      item.innerHTML = `
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
          <span class="num">${String(idx+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>
          <h3>${q}</h3>
          <span class="faq-toggle"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">${a}</div></div>
      `;
      listEl.appendChild(item);
    });
  }

  function toggleFAQ(header){
    const item = header.parentElement;
    const answer = item.querySelector('.faq-a');
    const isOpen = item.classList.contains('open');
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.open').forEach(el => {
      el.classList.remove('open');
      el.querySelector('.faq-a').style.maxHeight = null;
    });
    if(!isOpen){
      item.classList.add('open');
      answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';
    }
  }

  function filterFAQs(){
    const term = document.getElementById('faqSearchInput').value.toLowerCase().trim();
    const filtered = term
      ? faqs.filter(([q,a]) => q.toLowerCase().includes(term) || a.toLowerCase().includes(term))
      : faqs;
    renderFAQs(filtered);
    countEl.textContent = term ? `${filtered.length} result${filtered.length!==1?'s':''} found` : `${faqs.length} questions answered`;
    emptyEl.style.display = filtered.length === 0 ? 'block' : 'none';
  }

  renderFAQs(faqs);
  countEl.textContent = `${faqs.length} questions answered`;
</script>
</body>
